# Node.js Project Tasks
# Copy to project root as .tasks

# Development
0|Install|npm install|Install dependencies
0|Dev|npm run dev|Start development server
0|Watch|npm run watch|Watch for changes

# Quality
0|Quality|SUB|Code quality tools
1|Format|npm run format|Format code (prettier)
1|Lint|npm run lint|Lint code (eslint)
1|Type Check|npm run type-check|Type checking (typescript)
1|QA|npm run format && npm run lint && npm run type-check [depends: Format,Lint,Type Check]|Full quality check (all)
1|Back|BACK

# Testing
0|Testing|SUB|Test suite
1|Test Unit|npm run test:unit|Unit tests
1|Test E2E|npm run test:e2e|End-to-end tests
1|Test All|npm run test:unit && npm run test:e2e|Run all tests
1|Coverage|npm run test:coverage|Coverage report
1|Back|BACK

# Building
0|Build|npm run build|Build for production
0|Preview|npm run preview|Preview production build

# Deployment
0|Deployment|SUB|Deployment tasks
1|Start|npm start|Run production server
1|Deploy Dev|npm run deploy:dev|Deploy to staging
1|Deploy Prod|npm run deploy:prod|Deploy to production
1|Back|BACK

0|Exit|EXIT|Close menu
